            "notes": "the first power we pick is [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51).\nthis power is the core of increasing our attack speed.\nfor items pick wp and wlifesteal and the third one for your choice, one of the extra hp one, ammo, attack speed or extra buffs like [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) or [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418)\n\nit about what heros they have: Example for a lot of pallot or rounds like jQueen Orisa Soldier 76 pick armor, a lot of flankable heros pick shield or [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) or [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418), tanks you can bully like rein or sig pick ammo or attack speed\n\nplay style\nbe mostly in the front line and help your tank in the tank trade switch to any enemy that get close, sometime use tp on isolated target and you can try start a fight in a flank between fights",
