            "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:10:09.603774+00:00",
            "notes": "this is when the build start to really form\n [Shrouded Shrapnel](item_b7373fd2-69d3-453b-89f3-b5ce87dc0c3a) and  [Onslaught](item_3588e700-0ee3-44d0-bfdb-d01ad8b9efaf) work really well together you one extra shot have the extra pellets and with  [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) do more dmg to barriers and your magazine last longer so you still have the extra pellets\n\ncombine with [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) and  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) attack speed that will be apply between shield drops and you a tank and shield buster, the extra spread not effect that much when you very close to your target so its just an extra dmg\n\nthe build is still strong when if they dont have a shield tank even they have JQueen that she is very skinny\n\n#no barriers#\ntake more ammo so you dont run off even the common one is good\n\ntake  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) instead if they *have armor* or like [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n\nif they *dont have armor* at all take [Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec)\nif they also *dont have any shield* take [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) instead of [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66)\n\nyou can also pick  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for more sustain, better dps\\support duel potenstal and better ult\n\nbut [Onslaught](item_3588e700-0ee3-44d0-bfdb-d01ad8b9efaf) *is a must*",
